00:02:23.017 --> 00:02:24.993
Now let's listen to a conversation.

45
00:02:25.293 --> 00:02:29.292
I've started decluttering my flat. The less I own, the happier I feel!

46
00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:33.863
That's minimalism. The more you buy, the more you have to clean.

47
00:02:35.150 --> 00:02:37.417
