A, minimalism. B, interior design. C, co-living.

65
00:03:51.383 --> 00:03:53.592
The answer is A: minimalism.

66
00:03:55.083 --> 00:03:57.071
The more you practise, blank you become.

67
00:03:57.371 --> 00:04:00.247
A, better. B, the better. C, the best.

68
00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:05.843
The answer is B: the better.

69
00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:09.651
blank the weather, the more people go to the beach.

70
