A, Hotter. B, The hotter. C, Hottest.

71
00:04:17.117 --> 00:04:19.105
The answer is B: The hotter.

72
00:04:20.617 --> 00:04:23.127
A home without walls between rooms is blank.

73
00:04:23.427 --> 00:04:26.941
A, open-plan. B, tiny house. C, smart home.

74
00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:32.950
The answer is A: open-plan.

75
00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:38.214
According to the text, eco-homes reduce bills by using blank.

76
00:04:38.514 --> 00:04:43.317
A, air conditioners. B, solar power and natural light. C, bigger windows.

77
00:04:47.317 --> 00:04:50.024
The answer is B: solar power and natural light.

78
00:04:51.517 --> 00:04:56.085
Now it's your turn to speak. Would you prefer a big traditional house or a small modern home?

79
00:05:01.385 --> 00:05:08.008
A small modern home. The smaller the space, the less time I spend cleaning and the more I can enjoy life.

80
00:05:08.308 --> 00:05:09.506
Excellent answer, Nita!

81
00:05:10.517 --> 00:05:14.388
